                                        "entry_id": "ad095fd2-140a-3387-8e8f-521ad62270b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Preferring human beings to other animals. It especially alludes to (i) bloodsucking arthropods such as mosquitos, denoting the preference of a parasite for the human host as a source of blood or tissues over an animal host; and (ii) dermatophytic fungi which grow preferentially on humans."
